WEBVTT

00:06:57.436 --> 00:07:00.556
particularly by my colleague Farnaz
Fassihi of The New York Times,

00:07:00.556 --> 00:07:03.596
who’s an incredibly good reporter,
has brought out,

00:07:03.596 --> 00:07:08.956
I mean, some of the most terrible stories
of how young people are being dealt with

00:07:08.996 --> 00:07:10.796
in a very harsh way.

00:07:10.836 --> 00:07:12.836
And, you know, there was,
over the weekend,

00:07:12.836 --> 00:07:16.196
there was the burial of a young boy,
10 or nine years old,

00:07:16.236 --> 00:07:19.636
who was, you know,
a victim of all of this.

00:07:19.676 --> 00:07:22.516
And he was killed.

00:07:22.516 --> 00:07:23.836
And his funeral happened.

00:07:23.876 --> 00:07:25.756
There was another big protest there.

00:07:25.796 --> 00:07:30.476
And, you know, these things
defy normal behavior.